  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table class=\"article-table\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"font-size:18px;\">\n<th>Template documentation follows\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Note: the template above may sometimes be partially or fully invisible.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visit <a href=\"/wiki/Template:Clr/doc\" title=\"Template:Clr/doc\">Template:Clr/doc</a> to edit this documentation. (<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Documentation\" title=\"Template:Documentation\">How does this work?</a>)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"margin:0 1em;\">\n<dl><dt>Description</dt>\n<dd>This template is a shorthand for <code>&lt;div style=\"clear:both;\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</code>.</dd>\n<dd>It moves any content following the template below any objects floating to the left and/or right (TOCs, infoboxes, images, etc..).</dd>\n<dt>Syntax</dt>\n<dd>Type <code>{{<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">clr</strong>}}</code> in an article at the point you want the clear.</dd></dl></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205357\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 181/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1269/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 66/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.257      1 Template:Documentation\n100.00%   10.257      1 -total\n 80.37%    8.243      1 Template:Clr/doc\n 50.68%    5.198      1 Template:T\n 23.09%    2.369     20 Template:T/piece\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:54-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205